==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|hófr|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|hōfaz|lang=is}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|kōpos|lang=is}}. Whence also Old English {{term|hof|hōf|lang=ang}} (English {{term|hoof|lang=en}}); Old High German {{term|huof}} (German {{term|Huf|lang=de}}); Old Saxon {{term|hof}} (Dutch {{term|hoef}}).

